OL,5,G1900 Manchester United vs Leeds United:
OL,6,G     Pre Season Friendly
OL,7,     FManchester United v Leeds United
OL,8,     F(Kick-off 7.30pm). Hugh
OL,9,     FWoozencroft presents coverage of
OL,10,     Fthe friendly at Croke Park in
OL,11,     FDublin. Normally used for Gaelic
OL,12,     Fsports, this is the first time
OL,13,     Fthis 80,000 capacity venue has
OL,14,     Fhosted a club association football
OL,15,     Fmatch, and while a friendly in
OL,16,     Fname, it is likely to be a highly
OL,17,     Fcompetitive contest given the
OL,18,     Fhistoric rivalry between the
OL,19,     Fteams. With analysis from John
OL,20,     FO'Shea and Michael Brown,
